enters Take Off\",\n     \"chars\": 4284\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:6c62a57b64473d2ac15a53ad\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-15\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia Starts H200 AI Chip Shipments to China as US Approves Limited Exports\",\n     \"chars\": 3147\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:9441cc2db54381b3673015ad\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-15\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia turns $5B Intel stock bet into $30B windfall — filing reveals new $21B SpaceX stake and complete exit from Arm stock\",\n     \"chars\": 3442\n    }\n   ]\n  }\n }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
